// Modified Boolean port of Cedar PartialResponse::decision at
// 5af7b8cd78e4e0da3ae23f1715023fff8e62941d; see conformance/programs/cedar/NOTICE
// and LICENSE-APACHE at the repository root.
enum PartialDecision { Deny, Allow, Unknown }

fn partial_decision(
    satisfied_forbid: Bool,
    satisfied_permit: Bool,
    residual_permit: Bool,
    residual_forbid: Bool,
) -> PartialDecision
    intent "Deny on a satisfied forbid or no possible permit; allow on a satisfied permit with no possible forbid; otherwise keep the decision unknown."
    ensures result == Deny implies satisfied_forbid or (not satisfied_permit and not residual_permit)
    ensures satisfied_forbid or (not satisfied_permit and not residual_permit) implies result == Deny
    ensures result == Allow implies not satisfied_forbid and satisfied_permit
    ensures not satisfied_forbid and satisfied_permit implies result == Allow
    ensures result == Unknown implies not satisfied_forbid and not satisfied_permit and residual_permit
    ensures not satisfied_forbid and not satisfied_permit and residual_permit implies result == Unknown
decide {
    | satisfied_forbid                            => Deny
    | not satisfied_permit and not residual_permit => Deny
    | satisfied_permit                            => Allow
    | residual_forbid                             => Unknown
    | otherwise                                   => Unknown
}

example partial_decision(satisfied_forbid: true, satisfied_permit: false, residual_permit: false, residual_forbid: false) == Deny
example partial_decision(satisfied_forbid: false, satisfied_permit: false, residual_permit: false, residual_forbid: true) == Deny
example partial_decision(satisfied_forbid: false, satisfied_permit: false, residual_permit: true, residual_forbid: false) == Unknown
example partial_decision(satisfied_forbid: false, satisfied_permit: true, residual_permit: false, residual_forbid: false) == Allow
example partial_decision(satisfied_forbid: false, satisfied_permit: true, residual_permit: true, residual_forbid: false) == Allow
